{"title":"Visits to the Doctor, Per Year","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/914658431/0/marginalrevolution~Visits-to-the-Doctor-Per-Year.html","date":1741778492000,"content":"<p>The number of times people visit the doctor per year varies tremendously across OECD countries from a low of 2.9 in Chile to a high of 17.5 (!) in Korea. I haven’t run the numbers officially but it doesn’t seem that there is much correlation with medical spending per capita or life expectancy.</p>\r\n<p>Data can be found <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://data-explorer.oecd.org/\">here</a>. <img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits.png\" width=\"2284\" height=\"1400\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits.png 2284w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits-300x184.png 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits-1024x628.png 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits-768x471.png 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits-1536x942.png 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Doctor-Visits-2048x1255.png 2048w\" /></p>\r\n<p>Hat tip: E<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/KirkegaardEmil/status/1897127122252259335\">mil Kirkegaard on X</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/visits-to-the-doctor-per-year.html\">Visits to the Doctor, Per Year</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/914658431/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/914658431/marginalrevolu